OL,3,GNEWSAInternational students urged to
OL,4,Aget MenB vaccine
OL,5,
OL,6,FInternational students studying at a
OL,7,FLondon university are being urged to
OL,8,Fget the meningitis B (MenB) vaccine as
OL,9,Fpart of a free NHS rollout for the
OL,10,Ffirst time.
OL,12,FThe vaccine offers protection against a
OL,13,Fdangerous strain of meningitis that
OL,14,Fcaused an outbreak in Kent in March and
OL,15,Fresulted in two deaths.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
